# Dated exceptions for the image security scan (trivy).
# The image workflow (.github/workflows/image.yml) reads this file.
# Each line is one finding id and the day its exception ends:
#   <finding id> exp:<YYYY-MM-DD>
# On that day trivy stops ignoring the finding by itself. If the finding
# is still in the image, the scan fails again.
#
# No exceptions at the moment. Every CRITICAL or HIGH finding with a fix
# fails the scan.
